Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:05.00,Header,,0,0,0,,This is a Gentlemen of the Hàn free fansub.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.93,0:00:06.58,Episode Title,,0,0,0,,{\fade(255,0,255,0,500,4500,5400)\pos(636.964,457.843)} Episode 50\N\N\N\N\N Fledgeling Phoenix Falls
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.66,0:00:09.94,Default,,0,0,0,,In the 17th year of the Jian'an era (212 CE),
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.90,0:00:14.34,Thinking,,0,0,0,,Liu Bei wrote to Liu Zhang, claiming that Sun Quan asked for aid,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.34,0:00:17.70,Thinking,,0,0,0,,and that he himself needs to return to Jing Province with troops.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.74,0:00:21.86,Thinking,,0,0,0,,For this reason, he asked Liu Zhang to supply \Na hundred thousand {\i1}hu{\i0} of grain
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.90,0:00:24.82,Thinking,,0,0,0,,and lend thirty or forty thousand troops to his command.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.88,0:00:30.14,Thinking,,0,0,0,,Liu Zhang replied that he could only supply a tenth of the grain,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.14,0:00:32.94,Thinking,,0,0,0,,and four thousand old and weak soldiers.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.42,0:00:33.46,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(933.39,238.636)}Liú Bèi \NStyled: Xuándé
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.94,0:00:34.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Shiyuan, come, come.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.80,0:00:43.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Now that the matters have come to this, what can be done?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.22,0:00:49.54,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(292.026,297.273)}Páng Tǒng \NStyled: Shìyuán
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.02,0:00:45.86,Default,,0,0,0,,My Lord,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.02,0:00:51.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I have three plans: upper, middle, and lower.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.56,0:00:53.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Would my Lord please choose one?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.38,0:00:58.94,Default,,0,0,0,,What would the upper plan be?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.48,0:01:04.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Choose the finest troops and strong generals, prepare the rations,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.64,0:01:07.16,Default,,0,0,0,,and while Liu Zhang is off-guard,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.16,0:01:10.00,Default,,0,0,0,,march in without stop and seize Chengdu directly.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.44,0:01:14.12,Default,,0,0,0,,This way, the Western Riverlands can be taken in one battle.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.00,0:01:22.52,Default,,0,0,0,,What would the middle plan be?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.26,0:01:23.74,Default,,0,0,0,,My Lord,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.14,0:01:32.50,Default,,0,0,0,,The Fushui Pass is a key chokepoint on the way to Chengdu,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.90,0:01:37.26,Default,,0,0,0,,and is an unavoidable road back to Jing Province.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.32,0:01:42.14,Default,,0,0,0,,It is now guarded by generals Yang Huai and Gao Pei of Shu.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.68,0:01:46.68,Default,,0,0,0,,My Lord can send someone with a letter,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.20,0:01:50.90,Default,,0,0,0,,pretend to return to Jing Province,\Nand pass through their land.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.76,0:01:54.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Those two will come out of the pass to see us off.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.44,0:01:58.16,Default,,0,0,0,,And then...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.54,0:02:04.88,Default,,0,0,0,,...afterwards, we seize Chengdu.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.80,0:02:16.40,Default,,0,0,0,,What would be the lower plan, then?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.02,0:02:23.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Put the operation to take the Western Riverlands aside for now,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.50,0:02:26.66,Default,,0,0,0,,fall back to Jing Province immediately.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.50,0:02:32.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Act upon it later, and proceed slowly.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.06,0:02:39.26,Default,,0,0,0,,The upper plan is perhaps too radical,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.34,0:02:45.14,Default,,0,0,0,,but the lower plan might be too conservative.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.36,0:02:51.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I believe that the middle plan is neither too radical nor too conservative...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.64,0:02:55.32,Default,,0,0,0,,... it is just right and actionable.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.60,0:03:00.10,Default,,0,0,0,,If that is the case, would my Lord please draft a letter,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.10,0:03:02.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I shall muster the troops.\NWe will seize the pass.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.06,0:03:14.10,Default,,0,0,0,,My Lord, Strategos,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.12,0:03:17.68,Default,,0,0,0,,the entire household of Zhang Song, \Nthe aide-de-camp of Yi Province, has been executed!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.10,0:03:20.56,Default,,0,0,0,,For what reason?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.14,0:03:23.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}Aide-de-Camp Zhang learned of my Lord's wish to return to Jing,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.50,0:03:29.20,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}and wrote a letter in secret, urging my Lord to take Chengdu immediately, promising cooperation.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.30,0:03:32.02,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}However his letter was discovered by his brother Zhang Su,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.04,0:03:34.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}and reported him to Liu Zhang. His household was executed.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.96,0:03:46.10,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}Oh...Zhang Song. He aided me in taking \Nthe Western Riverlands with all sincerity.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.76,0:03:51.76,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}{\pos(640,660)}He got neither a bit of gold nor a single {\i1}chi{\i0} of land,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.92,0:03:56.52,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}yet his entire family still suffered this deplorable misfortune, all because of me...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.02,0:04:24.90,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(981.151,276.818)}Fǎ Zhèng \NStyled: Xiàozhí
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.12,0:04:40.62,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(315.224,237.273)}Zhūgě Liàng \NStyled: Kǒngmíng
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.02,0:04:42.44,Default,,0,0,0,,With Zhang Song executed,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.18,0:04:48.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I expect that Liu Zhang will reinforce all the passes and chokepoints, bolstering all defenses.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.98,0:04:55.72,Default,,0,0,0,,The generals of the Western Riverlands have also hated my Lord's presence here from the start.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.24,0:05:04.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Zhang Ren, Liu Zhang's Chief General, is wise and cunning.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.34,0:05:06.78,Default,,0,0,0,,We cannot march with our army with any haste,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.06,0:05:09.26,Default,,0,0,0,,but instead proceed slowly.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.56,0:05:13.20,Default,,0,0,0,,With Strategos Pang Tong here, I reckon we should be safe from danger.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.54,0:05:11.54,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(290.661,242.727)}Mǎ Liáng \NStyled: Jícháng
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.52,0:05:19.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I fear that he would be too eager for achievements.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.00,0:05:26.42,Default,,0,0,0,,In that case, then why don't the Strategos write to our Lord about this?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.14,0:05:33.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Strategos Pang's place...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.18,0:05:41.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Tomorrow is the Festival of Two Sevens.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.18,0:05:41.32,Note (Potential style?),,0,0,0,,Note: Another name for Qīxī Festival
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.38,0:05:44.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Perhaps we should lighten our defenses and reward the men,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.52,0:05:48.82,Default,,0,0,0,,this way we can relax and celebrate the day with the people in the city.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.22,0:05:51.70,Default,,0,0,0,,We ought to be more careful during the festival.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.88,0:05:55.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Since Liu Bei occupied Fushui Pass, his troops moved with pace.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.10,0:05:58.72,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1020.725,450)}Liú Guì
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.14,0:05:57.82,Default,,0,0,0,,His strategos, Pang Tong, is not an incapable man,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.86,0:06:02.12,Default,,0,0,0,,and he would launch a sneak attack during the festival, when we are most vulnerable.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.82,0:06:05.24,Default,,0,0,0,,My Lord,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.34,0:06:10.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Zhang Song sacrificed himself so that my Lord may pacify the Western Riverlands soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.38,0:06:15.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Now that Fushui Pass is secure,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.74,0:06:20.04,Default,,0,0,0,,my Lord should immediately direct troops towards Luocheng,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.34,0:06:23.56,Default,,0,0,0,,so that Liu Zhang may not have a chance to reinforce and defend.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.58,0:06:25.62,Default,,0,0,0,,My Lord!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.88,0:06:30.76,Default,,0,0,0,,My Lord, Liu Zhang has sent four generals: Zhang Ren, Liu Gui, Leng Bao, and Deng Xian
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.86,0:06:32.84,Default,,0,0,0,,to reinforce Luocheng with fifty thousand troops.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.84,0:06:37.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Now Leng Bao, and Deng Xian have made camp separately sixty {\i1}lǐ{\i0} to the north of Luocheng.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.74,0:06:44.22,Default,,0,0,0,,My Lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.58,0:06:52.34,Default,,0,0,0,,There is a chokepoint sixty {\i1}li{\i0} to the north of the city.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.68,0:06:56.66,Default,,0,0,0,,With steep mountains and narrow roads, \Neasy to defend and difficult to attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.78,0:07:00.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Without taking it first, the troops will not be able to approach Luocheng.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.30,0:07:06.40,Default,,0,0,0,,It looks like Zhang Ren and the other generals are not without merit.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.44,0:07:21.62,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}{\pos(640,660)}... However, we could falsify an omen.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.56,0:07:23.64,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}{\pos(640,660)}How can we do this?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.82,0:07:38.40,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}{\pos(640,660)}I, Liang, calculated the {\i1}Taiyi{\i0} Divination at night:
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.54,0:07:42.24,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}this year, the {\i1}Guisi{\i0} year, {\bord12}the handle of the Big Dipper is at the west...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.30,0:07:45.98,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}Seeing the heavenly signs, I see that Venus approaches Luocheng.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.04,0:07:50.56,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}There is an ill omen upon our leading officers, thus it is prudent to be cautious.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.42,0:07:53.84,Thinking,,0,0,0,,Since I joined the Imperial Uncle,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.94,0:07:56.72,Thinking,,0,0,0,,I had no chances to accomplish great feats until now.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.84,0:07:59.78,Thinking,,0,0,0,,This time in the Riverlands, I can reveal my brilliance,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.84,0:08:02.44,Thinking,,0,0,0,,yet Kongming has sent a letter from afar to stop me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.48,0:08:05.92,Thinking,,0,0,0,,Is he afraid that I will take the Riverlands and seize all the credit for myself?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.88,0:08:13.14,Default,,0,0,0,,What does the Strategos think about Kongming's words in his letter?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.48,0:08:21.02,Default,,0,0,0,,My thoughts are the complete opposite of his.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.48,0:08:26.44,Default,,0,0,0,,My Lord, the key to victory is to seize the opportunity.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.62,0:08:30.26,Default,,0,0,0,,A good chance missed is hard to find for a thousand years.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.20,0:08:34.00,Default,,0,0,0,,It is not that I do not know the profits and losses,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.46,0:08:38.12,Default,,0,0,0,,but Kongming has always predicted affairs with divine accuracy.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.46,0:08:42.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I do not see anything to doubt in his words.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.76,0:08:48.10,Default,,0,0,0,,My Lord, you have been confused by Kongming's words!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.84,0:08:52.94,Default,,0,0,0,,He does not want to let me to get all the credit alone,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.54,0:08:57.52,Default,,0,0,0,,so he said that intentionally in order to confound my Lord's heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.86,0:09:00.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, Kongming is not an envious man.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.58,0:09:02.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Strategos, you are perhaps being too skeptical!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.02,0:09:07.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Kongming is far away in Jing Province.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.76,0:09:10.76,Default,,0,0,0,,As for the military situation and geography of Luocheng,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.94,0:09:14.26,Default,,0,0,0,,how could he see them all?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.14,0:09:20.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Allow me to consider this some more, and discuss another time.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.18,0:10:00.80,Default,,0,0,0,,My Lord has not retired yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.02,0:10:04.28,Default,,0,0,0,,What does the Strategos wish to say, coming so late at night?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.78,0:10:11.92,Default,,0,0,0,,My Lord, what festival is tomorrow?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.60,0:10:13.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Does my Lord know?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.18,0:10:15.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Today is July the Sixth.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.68,0:10:19.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Tomorrow is...July the Seventh.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.26,0:10:21.71,Default,,0,0,0,,The Festival of Two Sevens!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.94,0:10:23.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Exactly!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.86,0:10:27.62,Default,,0,0,0,,This festival is nothing special in the Central Plains,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.62,0:10:30.23,Default,,0,0,0,,but in the Western Riverlands, it is extraordinary.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.54,0:10:37.23,Default,,0,0,0,,All households of the Riverlands on this day set out food and wine to celebrate.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.06,0:10:41.82,Default,,0,0,0,,The army, too, ceases fighting and celebrates according to rules,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.04,0:10:44.25,Default,,0,0,0,,to reward the troops.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.82,0:10:50.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Would this not be a heaven-sent opportunity to attack Luocheng?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.68,0:10:58.98,Default,,0,0,0,,But Zhang Ren is an astute man and is cautious in his use of force.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.44,0:11:01.69,Default,,0,0,0,,What if he is prepared?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.00,0:11:02.77,Default,,0,0,0,,My Lord,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.00,0:11:07.95,Default,,0,0,0,,this map of Zhang Song's is marvelous!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.64,0:11:11.32,Default,,0,0,0,,It can prevent Zhang Ren from defending effectively.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.02,0:11:13.38,Default,,0,0,0,,My Lord, please look.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.60,0:11:18.02,Default,,0,0,0,,To the north of this mountain lies a wide road,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.02,0:11:20.64,Default,,0,0,0,,that leads to the east gate of Luocheng.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.06,0:11:25.71,Default,,0,0,0,,There is also a narrow road south-side that leads directly to the {\i1}western{\i0} gate of Luocheng.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.44,0:11:31.61,Default,,0,0,0,,This road, though marked on the map, does not have a name.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.50,0:11:34.65,Default,,0,0,0,,It is far too remote for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.24,0:11:39.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I asked the locals and more than half do not know of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.90,0:11:40.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.14,0:11:45.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Zhang Ren does not know we have this map,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.98,0:11:49.64,Default,,0,0,0,,and would surely think that we do not know of this road either.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.50,0:11:57.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Is this map not our key to victory, as if a sign from above?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.26,0:12:01.82,Default,,0,0,0,,So we make a feint attack from the wide road, make a sneak attack from the narrow road,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.82,0:12:03.96,Default,,0,0,0,,and to attack Luocheng together from both sides?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.32,0:12:06.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Exactly right!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.34,0:12:09.09,Default,,0,0,0,,My Lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.34,0:12:13.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Is this something that Kongming, far away in Jing Province,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.28,0:12:16.22,Default,,0,0,0,,would be able to know?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.54,0:12:18.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Invite Fa Xiaozhi here at once.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.98,0:12:19.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.62,0:12:23.98,Default,,0,0,0,,How likely are we to win if we use this strategy?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.52,0:12:28.75,Default,,0,0,0,,If this plan succeeds, then Luocheng can be taken in one battle.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.50,0:12:32.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Our army can then proceed all the way down,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.52,0:12:36.78,Default,,0,0,0,,seize Chengdu, capture Liu Zhang, and pacify the Riverlands in one fell swoop.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.06,0:12:41.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Then, with one part of the three under heaven in hand,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.13,0:12:45.26,Default,,0,0,0,,my Lord can then fight for supremacy under heaven against Cao Cao and Sun Quan!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.50,0:12:46.09,Default,,0,0,0,,My Lord,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.72,0:12:50.27,Default,,0,0,0,,the great cause of reviving the Han Dynasty will be at hand!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.48,0:12:52.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Good!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.50,0:12:56.39,Default,,0,0,0,,My Lord, Strategos Pang,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.18,0:13:01.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Xiaozhi, what are the roads from here to Luocheng?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.38,0:13:03.77,Default,,0,0,0,,There are two roads suitable for advancement.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.77,0:13:06.70,Default,,0,0,0,,The wide road, from the north, leads to the east gate of Luocheng,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.70,0:13:10.06,Default,,0,0,0,,while a narrow road leads to the west gate of Luocheng.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.10,0:13:12.08,Default,,0,0,0,,It is remote and difficult to tread,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.62,0:13:15.84,Default,,0,0,0,,and very few of the local people walk this path.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.00,0:13:20.30,Default,,0,0,0,,In your opinion, which road would be the best one to use?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.00,0:13:25.62,Default,,0,0,0,,We should make a feint attack, and one real attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.64,0:13:27.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Move separately, but strike in unison.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.79,0:13:29.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Then victory can then be assured.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.76,0:13:32.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Then both of you gentlemen are in agreement.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.46,0:13:34.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Tomorrow I shall send a detachment.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.46,0:13:38.00,Default,,0,0,0,,The Strategos and I will attack Luocheng in two ways.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.26,0:13:43.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I will leave thirty thousand troops here. Can Xiaozhi please help Mi Zhu and Jian Yong defend the camp?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.94,0:13:44.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, my Lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.44,0:13:45.94,Default,,0,0,0,,My Lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.60,0:13:49.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Tomorrow, my Lord should lead half the troops through the wide road,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.94,0:13:51.66,Default,,0,0,0,,and I will go through the narrow road.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.12,0:13:53.19,Default,,0,0,0,,No, no, no...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.54,0:13:57.06,Default,,0,0,0,,The narrow road is remote and difficult to tread. How could I allow the Strategos to take the risk?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.06,0:13:59.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I've been riding on narrow roads ever since I first rode a horse,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.22,0:14:01.42,Default,,0,0,0,,it is better for the Strategist to use the wide road.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.42,0:14:03.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Then, my Lord...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.78,0:14:08.39,Default,,0,0,0,,My Lord, there will be enemy soldiers blocking the wide path,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.39,0:14:10.35,Default,,0,0,0,,my Lord can attack them.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.35,0:14:13.78,Default,,0,0,0,,The narrow road is hard to tread, but the enemy can be taken by surprise.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.03,0:14:17.17,Default,,0,0,0,,I use the narrow road specifically to avoid danger.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.17,0:14:19.74,Default,,0,0,0,,My Lord, why not allow it?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.20,0:14:21.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh...this...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.90,0:14:28.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Truth be told, though the Strategos' analysis have convinced me,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.90,0:14:34.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Kongming's letter still indeed causes me to worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.70,0:14:36.13,Default,,0,0,0,,What if the narrow path...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.12,0:14:37.87,Default,,0,0,0,,My Lord,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.96,0:14:44.13,Default,,0,0,0,,I have enjoyed my Lord's great kindness since joining the cause,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.46,0:14:46.40,Default,,0,0,0,,but have still not repaid it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.42,0:14:52.42,Default,,0,0,0,,To offer my life in loyalty matches my conscience.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.00,0:14:55.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Not to mention that the narrow path might not have dangers,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.30,0:14:58.90,Default,,0,0,0,,even if it does, what do I have to fear?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.90,0:15:00.61,Default,,0,0,0,,My Lord, say no more!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.61,0:15:03.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I will use the narrow path, while my Lord will use the wide path!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.24,0:15:04.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.72,0:15:08.90,Default,,0,0,0,,If would be better if the Strategos could use the wide road.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.90,0:15:11.50,Default,,0,0,0,,My Lord, please rest early.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.50,0:15:14.50,Default,,0,0,0,,We shall tear down the camp at dawn and move out by morning!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.50,0:15:18.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Luocheng is the gateway to Chengdu.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.62,0:15:24.22,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(792.836,474.545)}Zhāng Rèn
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.84,0:15:21.50,Default,,0,0,0,,If we lose it, it will bring great calamity to us all.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.50,0:15:24.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Not only the defenses cannot be lightened,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.98,0:15:26.89,Default,,0,0,0,,we must further reinforce it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.50,0:15:30.01,Default,,0,0,0,,We must not be careless.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.68,0:15:32.50,Default,,0,0,0,,General is correct.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.08,0:15:35.21,Default,,0,0,0,,General Liu can use ten thousand troops
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.70,0:15:46.48,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(285.203,295.909)}Wú Yí \NStyled: Zǐyuǎn
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.44,0:15:40.50,Default,,0,0,0,,to fortify the wide road to the east of the city. Wu Lan and Lei Tong can support from within.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.04,0:15:45.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if Liu Bei attacks, what is there to be feared?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.28,0:15:50.90,Default,,0,0,0,,The narrow road to the west cannot be left defenseless either!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.18,0:15:56.42,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}{\pos(640,660)}Perhaps General Zhang is being overly cautious.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.54,0:16:01.94,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}Both ends of that narrow road are hidden within vines and bushes.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.12,0:16:06.76,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}Not just Liu Bei and Pang Tong, even the natives of the Western Riverlands know little of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.94,0:16:08.76,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}Rather be cautious,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.10,0:16:11.80,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}than to give the enemies an ounce of opportunity.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.92,0:16:13.72,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}General Liu, fortify the wide road.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.78,0:16:17.08,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}Generals Wu Lan, Lei Tong, guard the eastern and western gates.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.26,0:16:20.86,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}I shall lead three thousand archers to defend the narrow road!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.22,0:16:21.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.34,0:16:39.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Strategos.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.52,0:16:41.60,Default,,0,0,0,,My Lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.60,0:16:43.74,Default,,0,0,0,,After much thought,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.74,0:16:47.78,Default,,0,0,0,,it would be better if the Strategist could use the wide road, and I, the narrow road.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.66,0:16:52.68,Default,,0,0,0,,My Lord's orders have been issued, and cannot be changed.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.08,0:16:56.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Please mount here, my Lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.34,0:16:57.91,Default,,0,0,0,,We shall meet at Luocheng.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.34,0:17:02.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Strategos!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.90,0:17:07.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Strategos, please be careful on the road.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.56,0:17:11.45,Default,,0,0,0,,My Lord, rest assured.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.58,0:17:13.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Please mount.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.50,0:17:16.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Strategos, please mount.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.42,0:17:18.06,Default,,0,0,0,,My Lord need not yield.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.60,0:17:20.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Please mount.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.30,0:17:22.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.08,0:17:24.68,Default,,0,0,0,,As the Strategos says.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.10,0:17:35.61,Default,,0,0,0,,My Lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.42,0:17:37.96,Default,,0,0,0,,We shall meet at Luocheng.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.70,0:17:58.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Strategist, why ride this inferior horse?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.88,0:18:00.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I have ridden this horse for many years.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.56,0:18:03.38,Default,,0,0,0,,It has never acted this way before.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.92,0:18:08.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Come, come.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.68,0:18:18.42,Default,,0,0,0,,This white horse I have ridden for many years.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.64,0:18:21.42,Default,,0,0,0,,It is tame in temperament and perfectly safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.84,0:18:24.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Strategos, please ride this horse instead.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.42,0:18:27.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no! My Lord, how is this permissible?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.92,0:18:30.46,Default,,0,0,0,,The narrow road is winded.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.59,0:18:33.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Should the horse fail, how would that be permissible?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.94,0:18:36.09,Default,,0,0,0,,I am used to fighting on horse.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.42,0:18:39.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Strategos, please decline no more.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.42,0:18:40.97,Default,,0,0,0,,My Lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.36,0:18:46.10,Default,,0,0,0,,My Lord!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.46,0:19:12.74,Default,,0,0,0,,My Lord's great kindness,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.30,0:19:17.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I cannot repay in ten thousand deaths.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.52,0:19:26.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Strategos.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.56,0:19:30.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Strategos, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.34,0:20:32.30,Default,,0,0,0,,They are here.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.30,0:20:51.02,Default,,0,0,0,,General Zhang, they are here.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.32,0:20:53.89,Default,,0,0,0,,General Zhang, we should attack now!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.04,0:20:56.38,Default,,0,0,0,,That is the vanguard. Do not respond to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.48,0:20:57.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Let them go.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.22,0:20:57.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.98,0:20:58.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Hide!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.66,0:21:03.43,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(305.6,270.4)}Wèi Yán \NStyled: Wéncháng
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.34,0:21:22.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Liu Bei must be in the rear.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.23,0:21:23.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait for him to come, and...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.70,0:21:28.99,Default,,0,0,0,,I once saw Liu Bei riding a tall, white horse.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.88,0:21:34.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Relay to all troops, the man riding the tall white horse is Liu Bei.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.24,0:21:36.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Shoot the man riding the white horse!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.30,0:21:37.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes sir!\NYes sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.70,0:21:40.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Orders, shoot and kill the one riding the white horse!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.47,0:21:41.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Shoot and kill the man riding the white horse!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.04,0:21:43.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Shoot and kill the man riding the white horse!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.38,0:21:44.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Shoot and kill the man riding the white horse!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.44,0:21:46.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Shoot and kill the man riding the white horse!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.60,0:22:38.07,Default,,0,0,0,,How perilous this place is.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.28,0:22:44.33,Default,,0,0,0,,-Strategos.\N-What?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.70,0:22:46.88,Default,,0,0,0,,There is writing on that canyon
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.34,0:22:51.71,Default,,0,0,0,,-You, go take a look.\N -Yes sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.08,0:23:03.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Strategos!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.08,0:23:05.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Luòfèngpō!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.09,0:23:05.50,Note (Potential style?),,0,0,0,,Slope of the Fallen Phoenix
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.28,0:23:09.65,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}Luòfèngpō?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.94,0:23:13.76,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}My Taoist title is {\i1}The Fledgling Phoenix,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.72,0:23:17.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}and the name of this place is "Slope of the Fallen Phoenix"...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.86,0:23:24.29,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}Could it be that this trip of mine is indeed unfavorable?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.68,0:23:31.02,Default,,0,0,0,,-What's happening?\N-What's happening?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.08,0:23:32.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Strategos!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.76,0:23:42.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Retreat from this valley at once!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.98,0:23:43.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Shoot!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.54,0:23:52.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Evade the arrows! Evade the arrows!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.66,0:23:53.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Shoot!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.66,0:23:57.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Evade the arrows!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.78,0:24:06.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Watch for the man riding the white horse. Shoot him!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.78,0:24:08.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Evade the arrows!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.18,0:24:14.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Strategos!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.14,0:24:16.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Strategos!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.64,0:24:19.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Strategos! Strategos!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.14,0:24:20.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry, save the Strategos!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.57,0:24:22.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Save the Strategos!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.84,0:24:31.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Strategos!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.62,0:24:33.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Strategos!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.38,0:24:38.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.02,0:24:40.17,Default,,0,0,0,,bring the troops,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.08,0:24:42.55,Default,,0,0,0,,out of this valley.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.06,0:24:43.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Strategos.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.16,0:24:46.07,Default,,0,0,0,,This map...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.82,0:24:48.50,Default,,0,0,0,,... is of utmost importance.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.62,0:24:52.12,Default,,0,0,0,,It must be brought to...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.00,0:24:54.72,Default,,0,0,0,,...brought to the hands of our Lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.62,0:24:59.04,Default,,0,0,0,,We are willing to live and die together with the Strategos!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.92,0:25:03.22,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}Death is not worth fearing,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.70,0:25:09.88,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}I only regret not listening to Kongming's words,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.24,0:25:16.75,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}I was too greedy for merit. \NI am ashamed to face my Lord,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.36,0:25:23.41,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}ashamed to face the troops of the three armies.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.26,0:25:31.06,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}Please be sure to tell my Lord
Dialogue: 0,0:25:32.08,0:25:40.06,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}not to worry about me.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.06,0:25:59.59,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}White horse...white horse! My Lord's white horse!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.32,0:26:06.15,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}I can no longer accompany my Lord with you,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.15,0:26:10.51,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}to march under heaven!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:22.02,0:26:28.02,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}What a great white horse!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.94,0:26:40.38,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,651.2)}Slope of the Fallen Phoenix
Dialogue: 0,0:26:42.84,0:26:47.76,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}Slope—of the—Fallen Phoenix!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:52.38,0:26:55.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Strategos! Strategos!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:56.64,0:26:59.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Strategos! Strategos!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.12,0:27:37.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Shiyuan died for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.86,0:27:42.46,Default,,0,0,0,,For me!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:48.86,0:27:52.03,Default,,0,0,0,,It is I who led the Strategos to his death!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:54.46,0:27:56.87,Default,,0,0,0,,It is I. It is I!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.04,0:28:00.37,Default,,0,0,0,,My Lord!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:34.70,0:28:37.02,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(387.798,297.212)}Spirit Tablet of\NPang Tong\NVice Strategist-General \Nof the Household
Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.00,0:29:04.56,Thinking,,0,0,0,,Pang Tong's death before achieving victory greatly diminished Liu Bei's morale.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:04.56,0:29:09.86,Thinking,,0,0,0,,He had to grind the plan to take the Western Riverlands to a halt, and return to defend Fushui Pass.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:09.90,0:29:13.60,Thinking,,0,0,0,,At the same time, he sent Guan Ping to Jing Province,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:13.62,0:29:19.25,Thinking,,0,0,0,,and to entreat Zhuge Liang to lead troops into the Western Riverlands for further planning.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:21.08,0:29:25.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Pang Shiyuan passed away in the Riverlands.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:25.78,0:29:30.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Our Lord has lost an arm, has retreated to Fushui Pass, and is now at an impasse.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:32.28,0:29:36.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I must go immediately to give our Lord aid.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:43.10,0:29:45.98,Default,,0,0,0,,That Zhang Ren shot and killed Strategos Pang,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:46.62,0:29:49.20,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(294.755,245.455)}Zhāng Fēi\N Styled: Yìdé
Dialogue: 0,0:29:47.40,0:29:49.77,Default,,0,0,0,,and trapped my elder brother at Fushui Pass.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:52.10,0:29:54.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I should meet with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:55.58,0:29:57.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Second Brother, Zilong,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:57.54,0:30:01.10,Default,,0,0,0,,we should all go slay those curs ourselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:06.70,0:30:07.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Third Brother,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:08.80,0:30:10.90,Default,,0,0,0,,if Strategos, you, and I all go together,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:13.10,0:30:17.10,Default,,0,0,0,,who is left to defend Jing Province?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:20.18,0:30:22.09,Default,,0,0,0,,The Second General is correct.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:23.66,0:30:26.16,Default,,0,0,0,,The Riverlands is still in the hands of others.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:26.78,0:30:28.94,Default,,0,0,0,,If something happens to Jing Province,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:29.60,0:30:33.62,Default,,0,0,0,,would it not ruin all these years of work?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:34.30,0:30:39.70,Default,,0,0,0,,However, our Lord's letter has not specified who should stay and defend Jing Province.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:45.64,0:30:49.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Although our Lord's letter has not explicitly named the person,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:50.40,0:30:52.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I already understand his intent.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:50.54,0:30:51.96,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(403.777,288.485)}Guān Yǔ \NStyled: Yúncháng
Dialogue: 0,0:30:53.84,0:30:56.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Our Lord sent Guan Ping to deliver the letter,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:56.80,0:30:59.67,Default,,0,0,0,,does Second General understand the meaning of this?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:03.10,0:31:04.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Strategos means...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:05.72,0:31:09.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Our Lord's intention is to have Lord Yunchang to bear this responsibility.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:13.44,0:31:19.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Yunchang, for the Oath of the Peach Garden, must guard with all your power,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:19.42,0:31:21.60,Default,,0,0,0,,and live up to this great responsibility.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:23.98,0:31:25.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:28.18,0:31:34.14,Default,,0,0,0,,In that case, the safety of Jing Province is all in General's hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:40.65,0:31:43.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Since Elder Brother and Strategos have given me this trust,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:44.65,0:31:47.90,Default,,0,0,0,,how can I refuse?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:52.89,0:31:54.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:07.45,0:32:09.40,Default,,0,0,0,,This is of critical importance.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:09.40,0:32:11.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Please be careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:13.12,0:32:15.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Do not be off your guard!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:16.66,0:32:18.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Strategos, be assured.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:19.70,0:32:25.66,Default,,0,0,0,,When a true man accepts a great duty, he shall uphold it until death.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:34.89,0:32:36.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Should Cao Cao move his army to invade,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:37.37,0:32:39.14,Default,,0,0,0,,how would General handle it?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:40.46,0:32:41.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Resist him with force.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:42.94,0:32:47.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Should Cao Cao and Sun Quan encroach at the same time, what should be done?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:51.04,0:32:52.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Divide the army to resist them.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:56.23,0:33:00.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Should this be the case, Jing Province would be in danger.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:03.95,0:33:07.13,Default,,0,0,0,,I have thirteen words, General. Please memorize them.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:07.50,0:33:10.24,Default,,0,0,0,,They can ensure that Jing Province is safe and sound.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:10.47,0:33:12.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Which thirteen words?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:12.30,0:33:14.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Strategos, please advise.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:16.41,0:33:20.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Make peace with Sun Quan to the east; resist Cao Cao to the north.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:29.61,0:33:33.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I shall memorize Strategos's words with great care.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:48.22,0:33:49.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Jichang?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:49.71,0:33:50.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:51.97,0:33:54.84,Default,,0,0,0,,You, Mi Fang, Liao Hua, and Zhou Cang,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:54.84,0:33:58.00,Default,,0,0,0,,shall assist Yunchang in defending Jing Province together.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:58.22,0:33:58.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:05.13,0:34:06.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Yide.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:07.75,0:34:08.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:08.85,0:34:13.77,Default,,0,0,0,,You shall lead ten thousand elites, and enter through the wide road and take Ba County first.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:13.77,0:34:17.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I will lead a detachment and enter the Riverlands by water. We shall meet at Fushui Pass.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:17.95,0:34:22.18,Default,,0,0,0,,The first to arrive shall take the leading credit. Go and prepare, we leave tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:22.50,0:34:23.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:48.07,0:34:51.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Second Brother...take care!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:01.25,0:35:03.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Third Brother...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:06.50,0:35:08.19,Default,,0,0,0,,take care of yourself too!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:16.19,0:35:18.19,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(312,488)}Zhào Yún\NStyled: Zǐlóng
Dialogue: 0,0:35:18.53,0:35:19.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Zilong.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:19.89,0:35:21.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:21.14,0:35:24.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Go and prepare the ships and equipment. Depart together with me tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:24.74,0:35:26.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Advance by water.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:26.14,0:35:26.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:37.15,0:35:38.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Yunchang.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:41.36,0:35:44.04,Default,,0,0,0,,What other instructions does the Strategos have?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:46.17,0:35:48.84,Default,,0,0,0,,With great responsibilities over your shoulders,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:50.02,0:35:51.86,Default,,0,0,0,,take care of yourself, General,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:52.42,0:35:55.06,Default,,0,0,0,,so that you live up to our Lord's great expectations.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:58.85,0:36:00.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Be assured, Strategos.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:02.10,0:36:06.57,Default,,0,0,0,,As I have accepted this seal,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:08.49,0:36:13.53,Default,,0,0,0,,I shall serve to my death in exchange for Jing Province's safety.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:21.65,0:36:23.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Why mention death?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:26.65,0:36:27.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Yunchang,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:27.90,0:36:31.84,Default,,0,0,0,,as long as you can make peace with Sun Quan to the east and resist Cao Cao to the north,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:32.17,0:36:34.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Jing Province can be protected.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:44.85,0:36:48.61,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}The Western Riverlands has many heroes, do not let your guard down.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:50.11,0:36:52.99,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}Gaining the people's hearts must be the first priority,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:53.30,0:36:55.80,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}conquering the land and cities is secondary.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:56.09,0:36:57.85,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}Remember with great care, General.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:58.34,0:37:01.40,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}Military discipline must be strictly enforced on the way,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:01.42,0:37:03.52,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}do not rob the people's properties.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:04.09,0:37:09.18,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}Any enemy soldiers that surrender must be treated with dignity.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:11.80,0:37:12.96,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}I will remember.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:14.62,0:37:19.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}General is of violent nature, you mustn't respect only the gentry and not care for the commoners.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:19.73,0:37:21.98,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}You should master your anger.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:23.42,0:37:26.77,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}Do not be inebriated excessively and beat the men under you.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:28.35,0:37:29.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:30.47,0:37:32.18,Default,,0,0,0,,...will correct myself, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:32.18,0:37:33.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Good!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:34.18,0:37:36.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I wish you a safe journey, General.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:36.38,0:37:37.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Get the wine.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:37.49,0:37:39.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, no, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:40.18,0:37:42.18,Default,,0,0,0,,After I get the lead credit,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:42.18,0:37:44.56,Default,,0,0,0,,it is not too late for Strategos to toast.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:45.18,0:37:46.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:47.93,0:37:48.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:49.51,0:37:52.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Get to Fushui Pass early to meet me, and I shall offer a toast.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:53.39,0:37:55.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Strategos is looking down on people!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:56.35,0:37:58.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Why don't you say {\i1}you{\i0} get to Fushui Pass,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:58.93,0:38:00.90,Default,,0,0,0,,and meet up with {\i1}me?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:02.65,0:38:03.90,Default,,0,0,0,,So,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:03.90,0:38:07.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Yide is determined to win the leading credits?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:14.81,0:38:18.36,Default,,0,0,0,,The water route, without resistance, allows for a straight push through.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:18.50,0:38:23.23,Default,,0,0,0,,The mountain route is winded, difficult to pass, and heavily guarded.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:23.23,0:38:27.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Isn't this bet too unfair to General?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:27.87,0:38:28.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Bet, bet, bet,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:28.98,0:38:30.55,Default,,0,0,0,,I indeed want to bet.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:31.73,0:38:33.75,Default,,0,0,0,,This is an unwinnable game.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:33.75,0:38:35.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Better not for the General to bet.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:35.56,0:38:37.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh no no no, I do want to bet.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:38.98,0:38:42.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Does General have the guts to make a bet?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:42.93,0:38:45.34,Default,,0,0,0,,It depends on whether or not Strategos dares.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:45.34,0:38:46.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Good, good, good.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:47.79,0:38:49.87,Default,,0,0,0,,You and I join hands to make a pledge.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:50.69,0:38:53.34,Default,,0,0,0,,-See who will arrive at Fushui Pass first. \N-Good!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:55.81,0:38:59.34,Default,,0,0,0,,This time, we shall see who wins and loses.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:02.34,0:39:04.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I will go first,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:04.08,0:39:07.34,Default,,0,0,0,,and wait for you to come to Fushui Pass to see me.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:08.70,0:39:09.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Set off!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:16.94,0:39:20.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Yide, with emanating pride, is of extraordinary martial prowess.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:20.94,0:39:22.94,Default,,0,0,0,,A tiger-like general indeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:24.11,0:39:26.38,Default,,0,0,0,,What a pity that he has a hot temper,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:26.71,0:39:29.38,Default,,0,0,0,,dealing with matters with recklessness.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:29.38,0:39:31.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Yide, though reckless,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:31.55,0:39:32.94,Default,,0,0,0,,is not without cunning.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:33.49,0:39:36.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Strategos might not be able to win this bet.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:40.34,0:39:45.06,Default,,0,0,0,,If it is indeed as Zilong says, I welcome it.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:45.06,0:39:47.06,Default,,0,0,0,,

